<title>USA: Burnham sees record net income/EPS year.</title>
<headline>Burnham sees record net income/EPS year.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burnham Corp said on Monday that based on record sales, it expects record net income and earnings per share for the year.</p>
<p>The company will be releasing earnings in March.  However, it reported unaudited net sales for 1996 of $159.9 million. The record sales were $16.3 million over 1995's sales.</p>
<p>Nine month earnings were a record $4.8 million, or $2.16 a share, compared with $2.0 million, or $0.88 per share, in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
